{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:pnpm-workspace.yaml",
    "title": "pnpm 工作区边界与依赖构建许可",
    "summary": "该配置把 apps 与 packages 下的直接子目录纳入 pnpm 工作区，并允许 esbuild 和 protobufjs 执行依赖构建脚本。它定义包发现和安装期脚本许可边界，但不描述应用功能、启动流程或构建结果。",
    "category": "configuration",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "workspace_scope",
        "title": "工作区包发现范围",
        "body": "工作区仅声明 `apps/*` 和 `packages/*` 两类路径，因此 pnpm 会把这两处的直接子目录作为候选工作区包。[[c5]] 该结构与锁文件中的 `apps/web`、`packages/ui` importer 相互印证，但配置本身没有列出具体包名，也不能证明这些包包含可运行实现。"
      },
      {
        "key": "build_policy",
        "title": "安装期构建脚本白名单",
        "body": "`allowBuilds` 只允许 `esbuild` 与 `protobufjs` 执行依赖构建脚本。[[c6]] 这是一项安装安全和可复现性边界：其他依赖若需要生命周期构建脚本，不能从本材料推断其已获许可。锁文件确实解析了 esbuild 的多平台可选二进制包，说明该许可与当前工具链存在关联。[[c7]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c5",
        "label": "工作区目录模式",
        "reason": "直接支持工作区只覆盖 apps 与 packages 两类直接子目录的配置事实。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:pnpm-workspace.yaml",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 3
        },
        "quote": "packages:\n  - apps/*\n  - packages/*"
      },
      {
        "key": "c6",
        "label": "依赖构建脚本许可",
        "reason": "支持安装期构建许可仅包含 esbuild 和 protobufjs 的结论。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:pnpm-workspace.yaml",
          "startLine": 5,
          "endLine": 7
        },
        "quote": "allowBuilds:\n  esbuild: true\n  protobufjs: true"
      },
      {
        "key": "c7",
        "label": "esbuild 平台可选依赖",
        "reason": "说明工作区构建许可与锁文件中实际解析的 esbuild 平台包之间的关联。",
        "relation": "depends_on",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:pnpm-lock.yaml",
          "startLine": 2103,
          "endLine": 2130
        },
        "quote": "  esbuild@0.25.12:\n    optionalDependencies:\n      '@esbuild/aix-ppc64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/android-arm': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/android-arm64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/android-x64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/darwin-arm64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/darwin-x64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/freebsd-arm64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/freebsd-x64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/linux-arm': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/linux-arm64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/linux-ia32': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/linux-loong64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/linux-mips64el': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/linux-ppc64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/linux-riscv64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/linux-s390x': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/linux-x64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/netbsd-arm64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/netbsd-x64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/openbsd-arm64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/openbsd-x64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/openharmony-arm64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/sunos-x64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/win32-arm64': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/win32-ia32': 0.25.12\n      '@esbuild/win32-x64': 0.25.12"
